<script setup lang="ts">import{ref,onMounted,watch}from 'vue';import{samples,loadBatches}from '../stores/samples';import{getTargets,getUnits,saveTargets}from '../api/batches';import type{Target}from '../types/domain';import{isAdmin}from '../stores/auth';import{dimensionLabels}from '../constants/enums';import{useTask}from '../hooks/useTask';import PageHeading from '../components/common/PageHeading.vue';import BatchSelect from '../components/BatchSelect.vue';import ErrorNotice from '../components/common/ErrorNotice.vue';const selected=ref(1),targets=ref<Target[]>([]),saved=ref(false);const{error,busy,execute}=useTask();const load=()=>execute(async()=>{saved.value=false;targets.value=await getTargets(selected.value);if(!targets.value.length){const units=await getUnits(selected.value);targets.value=['zone','age_band','mode'].flatMap(d=>[...new Set(units.map(u=>String(u[d as 'zone'|'age_band'|'mode'])))].sort().map(c=>({dimension:d,category:c,population:100})))}});watch(selected,load);onMounted(()=>execute(async()=>{await loadBatches();await load()}));const save=()=>execute(async()=>{targets.value=await saveTargets(selected.value,targets.value);saved.value=true;await loadBatches()});</script><template><PageHeading index="03" title="目标边际的同一把尺" subtitle="每个维度的目标总量须一致；正目标类别必须有样本支持。"/><ErrorNotice :message="error" @retry="load"/><div class="toolbar"><BatchSelect v-model="selected" :items="samples.batches"/><span v-if="!isAdmin">当前角色只读；由抽样负责人登记口径。</span></div><form @submit.prevent="save"><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>维度</th><th>类别</th><th>目标人数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="t in targets" :key="t.dimension+t.category"><td>{{dimensionLabels[t.dimension]}}</td><td>{{t.category}}</td><td><input :aria-label="t.dimension+'-'+t.category+'目标人数'" v-model.number="t.population" :disabled="!isAdmin" type="number" min="0" max="100000000" step=".01" required/></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="form-actions"><button v-if="isAdmin&&targets.length" class="primary" :disabled="busy">保存目标边际 →</button><p v-if="saved" class="success">目标边际已通过校验并保存。</p></div></form><p class="method-note">各维度都描述同一目标总体。不同总量、缺少类别或没有样本支持的正目标将被拒绝。保存不会修改已归档运行的输入快照。</p></template>
